{
  "description": "Story 20.5 — calculation cases of invoice / quote totals (remise, livraison, TVA par document ou exonération), reusable by the Bref React Native app (FUS-NFR8). Run by the backend through the served path (Invoice.draft → VatCalculator.compute; test InvoiceCalculationCasesTest). Amounts in XAF francs (integers). mode HT = prices without VAT (pricesIncludeVat false): Bref's formula — line HT = HALF_UP(quantity × unitPrice); subtotal = Σ line HT; net = subtotal − discount; VAT = HALF_UP(net × (Σ HT of STANDARD lines / subtotal) × rate / 100) once on the document; totalHt = net; totalTtc = net + VAT + delivery. mode TTC = prices VAT included (Keevo default, POS): line TTC = HALF_UP(quantity × unitPrice), line HT = HALF_UP(TTC × 100 / (100 + rate)), line VAT = TTC − HT; subtotal = Σ line TTC; without discount VAT = Σ line VAT, with a discount VAT = HALF_UP(Σ line VAT × (subtotal − discount) / subtotal); totalHt = subtotal − discount − VAT; totalTtc = subtotal − discount + delivery. rate = 0 when vatExempt, for EXEMPT / STATE_BORNE lines and when the seller is not VAT-registered; vatRate = the document's rate (percent; the seller's when no own rate). discount ≤ subtotal (else 422). Sources: bref-dump = every document of a local Bref database copy (amounts only; Bref « sans TVA » ⇒ vatExempt), bref-formula = Bref's own code (invoice.service.ts create, utils/line-total.ts) run on varied inputs, keevo-ttc / keevo-ht = the Keevo modes Bref does not have.",
